~ start
Spider: I want to go to a party!
if not GLOBAL.important_words['want'] and  not GLOBAL.important_words['to'] and  not GLOBAL.important_words['go']
	- Those's letters sounds like 'want', 'to' and ...'go'?
	set Language.known_letters.merge({"w": true,"n": true, "g": true, "a": true, "t": true}, true)
	set GLOBAL.important_words['want'] = true
	set GLOBAL.important_words['to'] = true
	set GLOBAL.important_words['go'] = true
	Spider: I want to go to a party!
=> END